              <li><a href="/bihar-police-signature-resize/" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors font-medium text-primary">Bihar Police Signature (CSBC)</a></li>
              <li><a href="/bihar-police-photo-resize/" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors font-medium text-primary">Bihar Police Photo (20–50 KB)</a></li>
